BASQUE TABLES — licences, in layers

The layers are deliberate. Different parts of this repository come from different
places and cannot carry one licence between them.

RECORDS  — data/nodes/, data/sources/, data/vocab/, schema/
  Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
  Attribute to: Basque Tables (NaN), with a link to this repository.

PICTURES — data/images/ and docs/images/
  EACH PICTURE CARRIES ITS OWN LICENCE, and that licence is the one that governs it.
  Every file has a sidecar .json beside it naming the photographer, the licence, the
  Wikimedia Commons file page and a sha256. The licences in use are CC0 1.0, public
  domain, CC BY (2.0/2.5/3.0/4.0), CC BY-SA (2.0/2.5/3.0/4.0) and FAL 1.3.
  Share-alike is complied with, not dodged: the credit rides with the file and is
  printed beside it on every page it appears on. If you reuse a picture, take its
  terms from the sidecar, not from this file.

TOWN COORDINATES — data/geo/towns.json
  Town centroids, compiled for this project. CC BY 4.0 with the records.

